			"notes": "# Release 1.0.0\n### New Items:\n- Shulker Ingot\n- Shulker Armor (Gives slow falling when you wear a piece)\n### New Mobs:\n- Watchling\n### Recipes:\n- Regrouped recipes\n- Wave end stones are now craftable\n- Dyes are now obtainable from mod flowers\n### World Generation:\n- Added 9 houses that generate all over the end dimension (Dark, Infusorial, Budding, Redleaf, Fire, Shining, Serene, Scab and Indigo)\n- Added Xorum Ore veins\n- Added 6 wave end stones veins (Dark, Infusorial, Redleaf, Shining, Scab and Indigo)\n- Added 9 trees (Dark, Infusorial, Budding, Redleaf, Fire, Shining, Serene, Scab and Indigo)\n- Added grass, tall grass, roots, sprouts and flower generation\n- Added Blastling, Snareling, Mawling and Watchling spawning\n- Added Indigo Squid spawning (although since it spawns in water, you won't find it on a non-player-modified end dimension)\n- Dark, Infusorial and Budding features spawn in the End Highlands biome\n- Redleaf, Fire and Shining features spawn in the End Midlands biome\n- Serene, Scab and Indigo features spawn in the End Barrens biome\n### Fixes and Implementations:\n- Implemented [IES-001](https://github.com/Pyrix25633/Fabric-ImprovedEnd/issues/2): Saplings should not grow into oak trees\n- Fixed [IEB-001](https://github.com/Pyrix25633/Fabric-ImprovedEnd/issues/3): End grass turns into dirt when an end tree grows on top of it\n- Fixed [IEB-002](https://github.com/Pyrix25633/Fabric-ImprovedEnd/issues/4): Wood models are not consistent with the log models\n- Fixed [IEB-003](https://github.com/Pyrix25633/Fabric-ImprovedEnd/issues/5): Trapdoors models are not properly functioning\n- Fixed [IEB-004](https://github.com/Pyrix25633/Fabric-ImprovedEnd/issues/6): Sign item textures are not consistent with the actual sign blocks"
		}
